    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751110/extras/1d6bd32dc1951bec72034edc7b3f54bc.avif?t=1730130062\" width=620 height=155 /></span><br><strong>Ordinary Stickman Goes For A Walk</strong> is mainly a 2D platformer with lots of different mechanics and a little bit of humor. The game offers various styles of gameplay as you progress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751110/extras/2fa089338cb00ad2f843b5f676ca92b4.avif?t=1730130062\" width=620 height=155 /></span><br>Ok, so here's a <strong>checklist</strong> for you:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Do you like platformers?<br></li><li>Do you like short games?<br></li><li>Do you like cheap games?<br></li><li>Do you like stickmans?<br></li><li>Do you like wacky humor?<br></li><li>Do you like various styles of gameplay?</li></ul>Well, if you answered yes to some of these questions you should consider <strong>buying this game.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751110/extras/af9191794b3509aebe308838ef6a527d.poster.avif?t=1730130062\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751110/extras/af9191794b3509aebe308838ef6a527d.webm?t=1730130062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751110/extras/af9191794b3509aebe308838ef6a527d.mp4?t=1730130062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>There he goes</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751110/extras/1d6bd32dc1951bec72034edc7b3f54bc.avif?t=1730130062\" width=620 height=155 /></span><br><strong>Ordinary Stickman Goes For A Walk</strong> is mainly a 2D platformer with lots of different mechanics and a little bit of humor. The game offers various styles of gameplay as you progress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751110/extras/2fa089338cb00ad2f843b5f676ca92b4.avif?t=1730130062\" width=620 height=155 /></span><br>Ok, so here's a <strong>checklist</strong> for you:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Do you like platformers?<br></li><li>Do you like short games?<br></li><li>Do you like cheap games?<br></li><li>Do you like stickmans?<br></li><li>Do you like wacky humor?<br></li><li>Do you like various styles of gameplay?</li></ul>Well, if you answered yes to some of these questions you should consider <strong>buying this game.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751110/extras/af9191794b3509aebe308838ef6a527d.poster.avif?t=1730130062\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751110/extras/af9191794b3509aebe308838ef6a527d.webm?t=1730130062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751110/extras/af9191794b3509aebe308838ef6a527d.mp4?t=1730130062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>There he goes</strong>",
